```css
body {
    font-family: Arial;
    margin: 0;
    background: #f5f5f5;
}

header {
    background: brown;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 20px;
}

nav {
    background: #333;
    padding: 15px;
    text-align: center;
}

nav a {
    color: white;
    margin: 15px;
    text-decoration: none;
}

section {
    background: white;
    width: 80%;
    margin: 20px auto;
    padding: 20px;
}

form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    width: 300px;
}

input, select, button {
    padding: 10px;
    margin: 5px;
}

button {
    background: brown;
    color: white;
    border: none;
}

.cake {
    border: 1px solid gray;
    padding: 15px;
    margin: 10px;
    display: inline-block;
}

table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
}

th, td {
    border: 1px solid gray;
    padding: 10px;
    text-align: center;
}

footer {
    background: #333;
    color: white;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 15px;
}
```
